# Engagement state and vector indexes are client-confidential - never commit.
# Matched broadly on purpose. These were previously listed by exact path, which meant
# a second data directory (data313/, data/chroma-313/ for the CrewAI interpreter) fell
# straight through and got committed. A rule that only holds for the directory names
# you thought of is not a confidentiality control.
/data/
/data[-_0-9]*/
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
chroma*/
demo/output/
